  <item>
    <title>18 在《影之刃零》发售之前，武侠离我们还远么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ad78386ef67611cac799a9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ad78386ef67611cac799a9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:27:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：摸鱼公、摸鱼侯、摸鱼侠</span></p><p></p><p><span>开始、结束 BGM：《刀剑如梦》周华健</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="29">00:29</a> 闲聊开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a>《影之刃零》即将发售</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 嘉宾的武侠阅读历程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 摸鱼侠小时候只玩武侠游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a>《新仙剑奇侠传》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 摸鱼侯小时候借书看金庸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 看古龙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 古龙经典行为：骗稿费</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="519">08:39</a> 操场对切口：流星蝴蝶剑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="532">08:52</a> 对切口也有失败的时候</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">09:23</a> 黄易</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a>《今古传奇武侠版》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="657">10:57</a>《杯雪》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="673">11:13</a>《长安古意》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="736">12:16</a>《开唐》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="794">13:14</a> 武侠已死</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 摸鱼怪曾在清华当面”拷问“小椴</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="928">15:28</a> 小椴文笔的造作是文人的造作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a>《杯雪》和《洛阳女儿行》很像金庸</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1005">16:45</a>《开唐》小椴形成了自己的风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 燕垒生的《道者无心》和凤歌的《昆仑》《沧海》更耐读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a>《长安古意》适合改编成公路片？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1167">19:27</a> 武侠 IP 改编已没落，《长安古意》连上桌的机会都没有</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 凤歌的作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 江南《中间人》和《青青柳上原》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a>《死人经》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1589">26:29</a> 台湾新武侠《英雄志》《江山如此多娇》《天之下》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">27:37</a>《射雕英雄传》《倚天屠龙记》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1737">28:57</a>《多情剑客无情剑》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1952">32:32</a> 金寻者《大唐乘风录》和赵晨光《隐侠》系列</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2022">33:42</a> 《绝代双骄》最像金庸的古龙作品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2056">34:16</a> 古龙的男主角大多聪明，金庸的男主角大多愚笨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> 《楚留香》《陆小凤》武侠侦探小说主角必须聪明</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2318">38:38</a> 凤歌也钟意聪明的主角，还有《天之下》的小明</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 被忽略的梁羽生与温瑞安</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2495">41:35</a> 温瑞安复出之作《少年无情》有点放飞</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2542">42:22</a>《战僧与何平》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2596">43:16</a>《逆水寒》口碑不错</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a> 还珠楼主《蜀山剑侠传》，想要看完真的好难</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2724">45:24</a> 王度庐《卧虎藏龙》的江湖与金庸江湖的不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">47:47</a> 《江山如此多娇》与金庸江湖的不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a>《绣春刀》与所有江湖的不同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3064">51:04</a> 武侠漫画《风云》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 师父强，徒弟弱，比如《英雄志》华山派，再比如郭靖和大小武</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3336">55:36</a> 《沧海》“显隐贯通”，创新的武功系统</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3396">56:36</a> 新武侠没落的原因</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 黄易《边荒传说》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 台湾更有武侠市场？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3529">58:49</a> 《仙剑奇侠传》《轩辕剑》还有河洛的武侠游戏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3593">59:53</a> 九把刀《猎命师传奇》《功夫》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3623">60:23</a> 甲山林《天命奇御》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3699">61:39</a> 《影之刃零》更像古龙的武侠风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3770">62:50</a> 古龙江湖更容易出海？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">63:03</a> 功夫朋克与武侠文化输出</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">65:00</a> 金庸江湖更偏中国文化，老外理解难度大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3974">66:14</a> 古龙吸收了剑戟片和侦探片的风格</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4031">67:11</a> 金庸吸收了大仲马风格，比如《基督山伯爵》与《连城诀》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4063">67:43</a> 《诡秘之主》青出于蓝</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4188">69:48</a> 《今古传奇武侠版》早已停刊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4238">70:38</a> 金庸新《九阴九阳》，后来用阳朔的笔名写自己的武侠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4420">73:40</a> 明将军系列到《山河》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4483">74:43</a> 女作者盛颜《三京画本》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4514">75:14</a> 沧月停止创作就是在毕业后去设计院工作</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4550">75:50</a> 新武侠作者的土壤：论坛，也已经不在流行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4567">76:07</a> 现在谁跟你讨论文学？哪怕武侠曾经还被认为不是文学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4645">77:25</a> AI时代，武侠有机会回来吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4802">80:02</a> 武侠能提取符合当下时代的新精神么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4897">81:37</a> 武侠的内核是什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5003">83:23</a> 《从姑获鸟开始》网文通过无限流方式吸收武侠元素</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5034">83:54</a> 美国的漫威是工业化武侠？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5116">85:16</a> 普通人的侠《海扁王》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5243">87:23</a> 小丑与《守望者》罗夏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5373">89:33</a> 牛马武侠与赛博武侠</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5486">91:26</a> 武侠里的侠讨论的很多了，武的部分呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5508">91:48</a> 徐浩峰的《箭士柳白猿》《刀背藏身》和《师父》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5600">93:20</a> 每代人有每代人的青春，每代人有每代人的文学</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5694">94:54</a> 播客录制前一天，《杯雪一战成名》上网大了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5733">95:33</a> 找回那个切口了：“天涯远吗？天涯不远。人已在天涯，天涯怎么能叫远呢？”</span></p><p><span>###########################################################</span></p><p><span>后记：</span></p><p><span>录完播客后，我看了《杯雪一战成名》。看的热血沸腾，仿佛又回到了二十多年前初看《杯雪》的时候。我突然理解了小椴的那句话：</span></p><p><span>”当一切雪逝冰消风流云散，我依旧记得你的容颜。“</span></p><p><span>2026年了，当武侠雪逝冰消风流云散，我依旧记得它最初的容颜。</span></p><p><span>—— 2026年10月21日</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f00d28cb673cf16bd82516/lrUEgHMuFiZ6lWp3vTg4BPFlRZ13.m4a" length="93807644" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:36:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpcH7q-lUFZ44NkoxHYLruN9kqLL.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
