  <item>
    <title>14 非白金玩家 | 《魔兽争霸3：重铸版》被遗忘的和被怀念的</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6abd42b0e742e36efcbd49ab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6abd42b0e742e36efcbd49ab</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Sep 2026 17:20:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目聊了《魔兽争霸3：重铸版》新战役“被遗忘者的王国”的全部剧情，包含大量剧透警告，请听众朋友们自主选择收听。</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾：熊熊</span></p><p></p><p><span>开场与结尾 BGM：《半兽人》周杰伦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">01:03</a> 开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 新战役“被遗忘者的王国”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 对战新增英雄：被遗忘者圣骑士</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="487">08:07</a> 被遗忘的：剧透预警，开聊新战役剧情的游玩体验（手机振动来自节目嘉宾）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4212">70:12</a> 被怀念的：关于 RTS 的回忆与菜鸟杯</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f00d28cb673cf16bd82516/lr1jz3a6WQ5vCIbKNk-1qd9tVXT3.m4a" length="76132872" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:18:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh8Q_lwFaVw-HbZj8IfyE0oSLOxm.jpg"/>
