  <item>
    <title>07 限制让我快乐：2000小时的《艾尔登法环》游玩乐趣</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68499cdd096eb0bc795414de</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68499cdd096eb0bc795414de</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 15:35:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>日常拖更...与新嘉宾策子聊聊他是如何在魂游里保持长时间的乐趣。感谢你的收听！</span></p><p><span>开头BGM：Dark Souls - Firelink Shrine</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 疫情期间接触第一款魂游：法环</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="104">01:44</a> 1940多小时的法环游戏时长，以及本节目第一位白金嘉宾！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 吸引力来自于培养性、剧情和音乐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 最爱流派：武器大师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="523">08:43</a> 除非死亡，尽量不坐火</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="681">11:21</a> 因为一些自加的限制，游戏的系统更有意义</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> 推图中如何分配资源</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 放弃轮椅来均衡难度</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1482">24:42</a> 像是黑魂1的复古玩法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 只喜欢玩游戏前期build成型中的阶段</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 各种魂like游戏的限制玩法</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1996">33:16</a> 就是不爱玩太刀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 黑猴游玩的目标：初见过</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2219">36:59</a> 从毒敌大王开始偏题聊起了黑神话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 黑猴几乎零成本换build的乐趣</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 安利怪猎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2656">44:16</a> 老号当新号玩</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">45:09</a> 重拾法环推图的动力</span></p><p><span>结尾BGM：Dark Souls - Gwyn, Lord of Cinde</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f00d28cb673cf16bd82516/llQPm6EmhqaUShg4T04Iy80rs1Yr.m4a" length="76530287" type="audio/mp4"/>
