  <item>
    <title>06 和4000+游戏时长的老猎人尽兴地聊聊《怪物猎人》及《荒野》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68459c3179e285b9b8daec2c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68459c3179e285b9b8daec2c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Jun 2025 14:34:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>继续拖更的一期，和新嘉宾聊聊《怪物猎人》为什么那么吸引我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头BGM：Dark Souls - Firelink Shrine</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 怪猎吸引玩家是因为共斗么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="350">05:50</a> 吸引我们的两大原因：武器系统和怪物系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="414">06:54</a> 从怪猎1的武器聊起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="572">09:32</a> 3代新的战斗设计带来了虫棍这样的新武器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> 海战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 太刀在历代怪猎中的演变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 双刀的巨变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 长枪的战斗体验越来越爽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> 轻、重弩不一样的狩猎体验：更深入怪猎的系统</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 老怪猎的调合书与调合成功率</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2122">35:22</a> 老怪猎丰富的系统带给了玩家更多的探索感与沉浸感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2350">39:10</a> 老怪猎系统的“弱引导”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 魂类游戏同样是遵循“弱引导”的哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3136">52:16</a> 长枪的战斗哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3440">57:20</a> 配装技能对武器/动作系统的进一步丰富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3655">60:55</a> 斩味对武器/战斗的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">62:00</a> 工房武器：机械+火药的蒸汽朋克风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3801">63:21</a> GP进一步加深武器系统的探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3868">64:28</a> GP与魂类游戏盾反/枪反的区别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3990">66:30</a> GU里每把武器各有5个战斗风格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4050">67:30</a> 未来怪猎的武器系统还能有什么创新点呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4357">72:37</a> 怪物设计在每一代是如何发展的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4373">72:53</a> 2代加入的古龙种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">81:10</a> 4代加入的狂龙病</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5010">83:30</a> 新时代的怪猎里机制怪影响狩猎体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5220">87:00</a> 攻击怪物不同的部位有不同的效果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5535">92:15</a> 《荒野》的受伤机制对肉质的弱化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5649">94:09</a> 狩猎时间五十分钟背后的动机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5797">96:37</a> 给《荒野》时间，也许完全体会让人惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5878">97:58</a> 《荒野》的游戏难度导致游戏时长的降低</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5950">99:10</a> 动作游戏的乐趣：高难度下的反复的练习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6240">104:00</a> 新怪猎的优良画面带来的生态休闲旅游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6402">106:42</a> 给《荒野》的跨平台联机点个大大的赞</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：Dark Souls - Gwyn, Lord of Cinde</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64f00d28cb673cf16bd82516/lnSvj5qut5Suc-vtcXM7Srg-Lj67.m4a" length="160117282" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:50:00</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FugKsq6DetgHAjL_FTCk3tCiQ_hr.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>05 非白金玩家 ｜《黑神话：悟空》善恶难辨黄风岭，满天妖佛尽吃人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e81a553a5ff0a0cad3648f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e81a553a5ff0a0cad3648f</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 11:45:24 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们继续聊《黑神话：悟空》黄风岭这一回。感谢大家收听！</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头BGM：Dark Souls - Firelink Shrine</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">01:49</a> 从“拨浪鼓支线”开始今天的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="444">07:24</a> 疯虎吃人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 虎先锋吃老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">16:18</a> 卧虎寺真是为虎先锋而建？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 斯哈哩国黄风岭时间线梳理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 由佛头开展而去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2028">33:48</a> 黄风怪何时拜灵吉为师？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 无头僧和灵吉是两个人？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">49:08</a> 大石敢当身上也有佛头？&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：Dark Souls - Gwyn, Lord of Cinde</span></p>]]></description>
