  <item>
    <title>04 非白金玩家 ｜《黑神话：悟空》如果是梦幻泡影，也足以让我们好好地梦一场！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dd7667bfd7110df4150a49</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dd7667bfd7110df4150a49</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Sep 2024 10:03:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>长时间不更新后的回归，感谢大家的关注！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们四个玩《黑神话：悟空》的小伙伴们一起来聊聊，经过四年的等待，我们自己对《黑神话：悟空》是怎样的游戏体验和感受。有前三章的轻微剧透。</span></p><span></span><p><span>开头BGM：Dark Souls - Firelink Shrine</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a>《黑神话：悟空》有没有达到我们的预期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> 大家游戏过程中是如何加点的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 印象深刻的剧情点和游玩体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2255">37:35</a> 《黑神话：悟空》的美术真的太棒了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2758">45:58</a> 这不仅是“玩”的游戏，也是“看”的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">48:15</a> 《黑神话：悟空》对我们的意义</span></p><span></span><p><span>结尾BGM：Dark Souls - Gwyn, Lord of Cinder</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后给大家上传一些我们游完过程中的摄影作品吧！根据我们目前的游玩进度，照片主要集中在前三章。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJrcwGO-9y0iMbONnywki-G7i6r.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft6j5Zvpls9ing9Fsdy-2FPNztBc.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhbsnwMJr6OZSOJilhB4XQ5nmV5e.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdP1jPD705uOnkyp1ojMD5jPseb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmyvEIBX3qIugRkd4gGwn0SoLfXk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSUmjY9TjD89PTdqYBdAAPRZMEP.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltA1aWjKWkGgC-RmrVeIn4N1GtJT.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llaQGvyz9v0Z43Yi-hun72giSVZU.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lqYKCk9LESNw4rxtDCuGgyGDNT5V.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkRvm4B5xlTHTqRrgWZ2Sr_nm3Xk.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FicPpp735cZLDvKgEIxPlYrfFZiI.png"></figure>]]></description>
